Year 9 Belgium Trip 08.05.26 🇧🇪 A hugely successful day exploring history and culture. After a 3:30am meet, we visited two cemeteries, trenches and a museum, before ending in Ypres with chocolate shops and ice cream. Proud of our students for being so respectful, thoughtful and polite throughout the trip - a day to remember forever 👏🍫🍦#tbcc
