World Book Day 📚✨ Check out some of our decorated tutor room doors as part of our whole school competition for World Book Day. We also had a reading focussed virtual assembly and finished the day with an after school creative poster session. Reading really can take you anywhere! 🌍📖 #tbcc #thomasbennettcommunitycollege
